<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48562" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θετός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίθημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>placed, set</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				251
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>having position</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιγμὴ οὐσία θετός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>APo.</u>
					87a36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>taken as one's child, adopted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				9.62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				359
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θετὸν παῖδα ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.57
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				929c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θετὸς γενέσθαι τινί</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπό τινος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θετός, ὁ</span>, <i>adopted son</i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				3.69
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θετή</span>
			<i>adopted daughter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. πατήρ</span>
			<i>adoptive</i> father, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				10.11
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
